    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "Malignant Phyllodes tumor",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Malignant Phyllodes tumor shows sheets of epithelioid and plump spindled cells with moderately-to-markedly pleomorphic nuclei and brisk mitoses. Necrotic zones and permeative margins are present. Focally, benign epithelium is observed capping detached frond-like portions of the tumor. ",
