    "fileId": 48490,
    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Benign phyllodes Tumour with stromal giant cell</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Phyllodes tumour shows broad fronds projecting into cystic spaces.&nbsp; Multinucleated stromal giant cells are seen, and while these can be observed in benign phyllodes tumours without impacting grade assessment, the presence of atypia in other stromal cells as well as the finding of increased mitoses in this case warrants consideration of a borderline grade.</p>",
    "source": "Imported from 5th edition<br><br><p>SGH Pathology</p>",
